    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basilica is an atmospheric journey that joins the thrill of adventure with the magic of art and nature. Experience a greater mystery by overcoming various floors of awe and perils. Use your abilities and your intuition to light a path towards the heart of the cathedral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE - Curiosity is rewarded</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Linger through several areas of beautiful and esoteric sights, encountering both challenges and wonders as you progress deeper through its floors.,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use your intuition to uncover keys that unlock magical doors, advancing your journey. Observation will discover many secrets and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hidden truths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Encounter bewildering creatures and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect a wide array of sacred artifacts, precious loot, and gear to evolve your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover a larger story at your own pace </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hone your characters abilities through magic, crafting, and combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Gain sacred wisdom to unearth divine capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Forage, fish, and collect ingredients for magical</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > recipes and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use the power of creativity to experiment with new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Craft essential objects that will help in a variety of ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Survive the mystical and cryptic nature of an enchanted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Prepare your weapons or magic to engage with the creatures below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose from different styles of combat to suit your character. Some are more relaxing than others.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basilica is an atmospheric journey that joins the thrill of adventure with the magic of art and nature. Experience a greater mystery by overcoming various floors of awe and perils. Use your abilities and your intuition to light a path towards the heart of the cathedral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE - Curiosity is rewarded</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Linger through several areas of beautiful and esoteric sights, encountering both challenges and wonders as you progress deeper through its floors.,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use your intuition to uncover keys that unlock magical doors, advancing your journey. Observation will discover many secrets and </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hidden truths. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Encounter bewildering creatures and characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Collect a wide array of sacred artifacts, precious loot, and gear to evolve your character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVOLVE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Discover a larger story at your own pace </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Hone your characters abilities through magic, crafting, and combat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Gain sacred wisdom to unearth divine capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>INTERACT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Forage, fish, and collect ingredients for magical</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > recipes and potions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Use the power of creativity to experiment with new items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Craft essential objects that will help in a variety of ways. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Survive the mystical and cryptic nature of an enchanted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Prepare your weapons or magic to engage with the creatures below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Choose from different styles of combat to suit your character. Some are more relaxing than others.</p>",
